/**
\mainpage caenN1470 EPICS Support Module
\section intro_sec Introduction
This module provides support for the <a href="http://www.caen.it/csite/CaenProd.jsp?parent=21&idmod=599">CAEN N1470 HV power supply</a>. Documentation for the unit is available <a href="http://www.caen.it/servlet/checkCaenManualFile?Id=8020">here</a>.

\section bugs_sec Setup
Default serial setup is:
- baud rate 9600 (can be changed)
- Data bits: 8
- Parity: none
- stop bit: 1
- Flow control: Xon Xoff
If you use the USB connection it will appear as /dev/ttyUSBx, otherwise set it up as a normal serial port.

\section build_sec Build Instructions 
- \subpage build_instructions_example

IOCs build using these build instructions are available in iocs/
*/
